// Balthazar walking through example/door's func_door to its path node (what the map's use
// trigger starts), read before, while walking and once there. Headless test player:
// compare-player.ps1 -Map example/door -Probe probe-xdoor; save-load.ps1 -Map example/door -Probe probe-xdoor -Thread save

probe:
waitforplayer
wait 2
stuffcmd "echo ==== before"
stuffcmd "whatis 0"
stuffcmd "whatis 1"
stuffcmd "whatis 2"
stuffcmd "whatis 3"
stuffcmd "whatis 4"
stuffcmd "whatis 5"
